<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices-Jan 28.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AWB Australian wheat indicator prices-Jan 28.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Wheat Board</p>
<p>international card prices for wheat exports for January 28.</p>
<p>In U.S. dollars per tonne, FOB eastern states.</p>
<p>		ASW	  AH     PH 13 PCT PH 14 PCT</p>
<p>    Jan    202.00    206.50    208.50    219.50</p>
<p>    Feb    202.00    206.50    208.50    219.50</p>
<p>    Mar    202.00    206.50    208.50    219.50</p>
<p>    Apr    202.00    206.50    207.50    219.50</p>
<p>    May    202.00    206.50    207.50    219.50</p>
<p>    Jun    202.00    206.50    207.50    219.50</p>
<p>Note: ASW = Australian Standard White; AH = Australian Hard;</p>
<p>PH = Australian Prime Hard; percentages = protein content.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
